jpeginfo
------------------------------------------
Prints information and tests integrity of JPEG/JFIF files

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libjpeg8-3.2.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libjpeg-devel-3.2.0-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/tjko/jpeginfo

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/tjko/jpeginfo/archive/refs/tags/v1.7.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack jpeginfo-1.7.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./jpeginfo-1.7.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/jpeginfo-1.7.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/jpeginfo-1.7.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(jpeginfo)
  /usr/bin/jpeginfo.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/jpeginfo.README
  /usr/share/doc/jpeginfo/COPYRIGHT
  /usr/share/doc/jpeginfo/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/jpeginfo/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/jpeginfo.1.gz

------------------

